  <title>Tool Magazine Adjustment</title>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading4">Tool Magazine Adjustment</para>
    </header>
    <list id="0" type="ol" listtype="decimal" formatstring="&#37;&#48;&#58;&#115;&#41;" format-charset="DEFAULT_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="margin-bottom:8px; font-family:Arial; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;">
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Use the ATC–spindle gap tool to verify the clearance between the ATC arm and spindle.</li>
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Adjust the clearance by repositioning the ATC unit using the ATC push‑pull block.</li>
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Verify the ATC tool change position.</li>
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Install the tool magazine level pad; adjust the bolt to achieve contact.</li>
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Tighten the nut below ATC with Hand tight is sufficient. No specific torque required.</li>
    </list>
    <para styleclass="Normal"></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"></para>
